; East Twin Swallet, Burrington Coombe, UK
; Grade 2 survey  (GRADE 3 only where indicated)
;    all survey data taken by David Cundy, South Bristol Speleological Society
;    100 ft fibre tape  (Chris Whale's)   read to the nearest 6 inches  (1 inch for grade 3)
