;     ROLSON    laser inclinometer        read to the nearest 2 degrees  (0.5 deg for grade 3)
; On 5 June 2006, the survey points in this file were completely renumbered
;
;
;  NUMBERING SYSTEM  =  CSnxm
;     CS = two letters       code for this cave system  (ET for East Twin Swallet, Burrington Coombe, UK)
